This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:37.330
April 2nd, 1587 - Chikuzen Province, Koshosan Castle

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:04.700
Can you please suppress those urges for now?

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:08.240
You will die if you fall.

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:09.280
Please excuse me.

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:13.790
I've only had sweet yam these last few days.

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:19.440
Did Lord Furuta take part in the battle for Shinshū Province's Takato Castle?

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:22.310
I did not expect you to know that.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:26.910
Nishina Morinobu's concubine ended up at our village.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:30.400
She has a child now and is living quite well.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.840
I see.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:40.330
My superb libido during that time allowed that woman to escape.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:42.760
Did she say anything else?

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:52.440
She said nothing about a superb libido but rather of a limp wiener.

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:55.880
The Devil's Whisper

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:06.750
We can't find the Narashiba anywhere.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:10.210
Maybe it's like what happened with Matsunaga Hisahide?

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:22.840
This is looking bad.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:26.610
Spies need to time their exits perfectly.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:33.130
Let go of me!

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:34.130
Please stop that!

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:38.930
I'm at my wits' end!

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:43.860
I'll be captured by Toyotomi like my father if I don't kill myself!

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.140
I'll be finished!

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:48.220
I don't know what that monkey will do to me!

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:51.930
How can the daughter of Akizuki be tormented like that?

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.440
Let me die as a pure maiden!

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:56.310
Stop that!

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.120
Akizuki's daughter?

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:06.150
Don't do it!

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:11.430
If the timing of our retreat is that important,

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:16.780
perhaps seeking beauty in the time of danger is just as important.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:18.950
That is the way of the aesthete.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:56.490
Taste this.

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:06.580
You're making me excited.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:08.660
These are quite some ears.

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:20.460
The taste of the capital and the taste of a man are both splendid things.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:25.210
I will report to the Chief Advisor directly.

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:29.770
"Please treat her kindly."

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:36.360
If you intend to surrender, of course.

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:43.810
Wait, Lord Ueda!

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:47.390
Didn't you get scolded for being too pre-emptive at Ogura!?

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:48.630
Shut up!

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:52.120
If I don't make myself stand out here, there'd be no point in me coming all the way to Kyushu!

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:11.820
What a guy, Furuta Oribe.

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:16.560
He may possess a limp wiener, but his heart may be huge.

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:22.220
What will happen to me?

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:28.060
I'd rather stay by your side than be handed over as hostage to that monkey...

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:29.730
I understand.

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:34.670
No matter who comes to me, I will be sure to keep you hidden.

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:43.780
I have captured Akizuki Tanezane's daughter.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:47.370
I present her to you.

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:51.460
What!? Didn't you just say you'll keep me hidden?

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.820
Good job, Sasuke.

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:56.270
You deserve a reward.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:59.300
Thank you very much!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:07.230
This was all thanks to Lord Hideyasu's orders and Master Sanada's efforts.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:08.710
Hideyasu?

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:11.700
That guy's pretty good.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.620
I left her attendant at the castle.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:18.830
He must have realized by now that his daughter's been taken away.

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:22.510
Okay! Time to proceed with negotiations.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:27.530
Tell him to give us the Narashiba if he wants to save his daughter.

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:28.410
Yes, milord!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.680
I will acertain with these two eyes the real thing!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.940
I will save it!

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:58.290
Don't be afraid. Come a little closer.

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:03.980
There now.

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:07.220
You must have fallen for Sasuke's sweet talk.

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:09.300
That guy's so bad.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:15.570
He is rumored to be the Hell's watchdog that killed and ate Akechi Mitsuhide.

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:17.300
Hell's watchdog!?

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:19.650
Even if I rule over the world,

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:23.720
I still find myself tricked by him from time to time.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.870
I understand your feelings perfectly.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:30.900
When Akizuki surrenders,

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:33.560
I will let you return to your family.

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:39.670
You're too kind!

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:48.440
You could say I love the daughters of nobles.

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:50.980
But regrettably, this woman lacks the qualities I look for.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:55.890
She's not joining my collection.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:58.810
We accept!

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:03.730
Akizuki Tanezane accepts the Chief Advisor's proposal!

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:07.730
Here is the Narashiba!

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:12.520
Please let my daughter live.

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:17.300
What a disappointment.

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.010
If you were a true aesthete,

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:23.880
you would have chosen the Narashiba over your own daughter.

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:28.060
Looks like this man only got hooked by the name of the Narashiba itself.

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:32.220
Well, I have no right to criticize others.

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:35.870
I'll have a look.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.690
Holy wow.

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:05.470
I really want to put into words the beauty that my eyes are feasting on right now.

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:08.610
Look at this brilliant coarse outer layer.

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:12.220
This simplicity screams its righteousness for the lack of adornment.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:29.500
Are you itching to taste my Magoroku Kanemoto blade?

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:35.830
The cover does not fit the description.

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.630
Give me a break.

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:16.830
April 4th, 1587 - Chikuzen Province, Akuta

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:30.320
I never expected you to shave your head, Akizuki Tanezane.

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:31.810
Father!

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:46.130
I, Gamō Ujisato, am floored.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:49.840
Lord Furuori's actions through the shadows were brilliant.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:55.790
You ended the battle without wasting the life of a single soldier. Just want the Chief Advisor wanted.

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:58.550
Shimazu of Satsuma is still fighting.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:01.900
But he will be easy as pie when we meet up with Lord Hidenaga.

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:05.940
I underestimated you, Lord Furuta.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:11.650
Please teach us about aesthetics and battle strategies in the future.

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:15.730
You must not anger the Chief Advisor first.

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:19.820
Furuta Oribe.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:30.840
May, 1587 - Chikuzen Province, Hakata

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:39.330
Shimazu has surrendered and peace has returned to Kyushu.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:41.860
Hakata is still a mess, though.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:44.740
Civil wars are quite something.

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:48.260
Sakai had a period like this, too.

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:52.980
Wearing these clothes brings me back to those times.

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:55.600
You look fine in armor.

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:59.760
This was a present for the square black tea bowl.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.690
I received it from Lord Furuori.

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:07.000
I feel a bit embarrassed wearing this, considering my age.

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:09.860
But you still have to keep on wearing it.

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:14.890
It'll be dangerous until the Chief Advisor comes back from Satsuma.

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:17.650
I am not familiar with these lands.

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:24.260
I will have to ask Master Sōgyū for help regarding tea ceremonies here.

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:28.210
Are you finished serving the Chief Advisor?

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:35.140
Now that I am here at a warm place,

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:37.360
I want to try something different.

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:41.810
Higo Province, Ariake Sea

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:50.800
Brother!

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:54.000
Master Takayama.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:56.100
It's been a long time.

00:13:56.860 --> 00:13:59.860
The Father knows many people here.

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:03.810
We've been all over Kyushu ever since we arrived.

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:07.860
This view of the sea is fabulous.

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:09.720
It is not only simplistic,

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:15.250
but as a man raised on land, the vast blue puts me in wonder.

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:19.180
I heard the southern seas are even prettier.

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:25.460
Perhaps the quality of the goods made there are related to the color of the sea?

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:31.230
Oh? I want to visit there someday, even if it's with Father.

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:37.020
What's the matter?

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:44.130
Nothing, really. It's just that I've seen things here that are not pleasing.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.230
Not pleasing?

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:54.550
I hope the Chief Advisor doesn't see any of that when he returns.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:58.500
Middle of June, 1587, Chikuzen Province, Hakozaki

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.580
Sorry for the wait.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:09.190
Father Coelho will accompany you by ship to Hakata.

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:15.550
Please accept this hat as a gift.

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:20.120
What a fearsome arsenal I see.

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:25.180
These ships are much stronger than our Japanese ships.

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:31.010
Korea and China will go down a lot easier with a few of these ships.

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:34.450
What is Coelho thinking?

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:39.300
Why is he letting the Chief Advisor onto the warship?

00:15:40.490 --> 00:15:41.440
Don't tell me...

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.580
Sell it to me!

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:45.420
No...

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:46.380
No!?

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.040
What's the matter?

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:53.090
I want him to sell this warship to me. He refuses.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:58.260
If he's not selling this to me, then why did he sail into Kyushu?

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:04.460
That's because...

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:10.890
Let me see the rest of the ship!

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:42.530
You dastardly missionaries take my citizens into slavery in the name of missionary work!?

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.940
Armor!? Why are you wearing armor!?

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:00.250
Are you in fact warriors!?

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:04.070
Are you trying to take over Japan with your naval might!?

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:04.990
Please calm down!

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:10.710
These people are not Japanese warriors. They are regular citizens.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:14.100
If I wasn't a warrior, then you would take me away, too!?

00:17:17.940 --> 00:17:20.130
Go back to where you come from!

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:25.530
Japan is mine, and mine only!

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:27.940
All missionaries are banned immediately!

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:40.550
That's the end of that.

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:44.800
All of the other Christan priests have given up.

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:49.650
Only Master Takayama is left.

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:53.310
Even your words can't sway him?

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:58.660
The southern lands have abundant saltpeter for making gunpowder.

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:02.150
The Chief Advisor is only willing to open up trade routes.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:06.700
He is against all sorts of missionaries that interfere with his rule.

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:13.380
Christian views on poverty is in line with our views on simplicity.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:18.000
I am a bit disappointed.

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:23.930
If Master Takayama does not give up, he is tempting fate and may be exiled.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:29.410
He needs to follow the Chief Advisor, if only on the outside.

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:33.240
Lord Furuori is Master Takayama's brother-in-law.

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:39.980
Please persuade him.

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:47.560
Come on in, Brother.

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:58.860
You need to control your tastes from now on.

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:02.830
I let the Chief Advisor see the worst thing ever.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:08.910
I already warned them many times that we do not participate in the slave trade.

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:13.690
Coelho is acting under orders of the King in order to display his might.

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:17.270
He wanted the Chief Advisor to set up Christianity here after seeing his tolerance of the southern lands.

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:21.430
He was just following orders.

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:23.690
That is too haughty.

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:28.610
The Chief Advisor believes in the Amaterasu.

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.740
He was too careless.

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:35.140
If I was put in the Chief Advisor's position,

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:40.700
I would have reacted the same way after finding out the truth.

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:45.460
Looks like you have made your decision.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:57.460
Not all of the Fathers are like Coelho.

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:02.610
There are good guys and bad guys among them.

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:10.460
The Father that I knew for a long time is one who believes in the sanctity of life.

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:17.430
My wife, your younger sister, has been converted.

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:26.470
I am not leaving the church due to their teachings.

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:30.620
I have three roles.

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:33.640
The warrior, Takayama Ukon.

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:35.910
The Christian, Justo.

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:39.430
The aesthete, Nanbo.

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:47.990
The world now is not a place where I can live on without knowing my true identity.

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:52.010
Now I finally understand.

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:58.050
I want to be remembered as Nanbo.

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:02.450
I have accumulated plenty of interest in the southern lands.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:07.180
I cannot let that change at the cry of a crane.

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:31.200
It has been a nice ceremony, full of austere karma.

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:39.500
The ban is about to be put into effect.

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:42.960
What will you do now, Master Nanbo?

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:46.640
I'll call up my famiglia at Banshū Province first.

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:48.850
We'll head toward Shōdo Island on the Seto Inland Sea.

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:51.090
And then...

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:57.060
Please forgive this idiotic brother of yours.

00:22:01.890 --> 00:22:02.860
Take care.

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:11.830
Please take this.

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:22.050
That is Narashiba's cover.

00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:27.010
The Chief Advisor has a fake right now.

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:32.140
Think of it like plucking a feather from the crane.

00:22:33.720 --> 00:22:36.310
I'm sure you feel much better now, right?

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:06.260
Everytime I　

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:06.260
Anata no mune

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:08.650
feel your heart

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:08.650
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:14.740
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:14.740
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:20.920
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:20.920
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.770 --> 00:23:27.080
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.770 --> 00:23:27.080
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:33.170
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:33.170
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:37.050
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:37.050
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:40.630
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:40.630
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:46.500
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:46.500
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:49.500
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:49.500
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:52.110
Without each other.

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:52.110
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:53.070
You should

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:53.070
Soshite

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:58.570
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:58.570
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:02.360
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:02.360
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:08.070
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:08.070
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:14.560
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:14.560
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:20.360
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:20.360
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.840 --> 00:24:26.340
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.840 --> 00:24:26.340
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:34.300 --> 00:24:36.000
What rustic beauty!

00:24:39.390 --> 00:24:41.120
This is good.

00:24:46.040 --> 00:24:47.640
I'm so jealous!!

00:24:48.410 --> 00:24:50.830
Come On Now, My Juraku.

00:24:51.730 --> 00:24:56.360
To be a warrior or an aestete? That is the question.

00:24:56.510 --> 00:24:59.600
Come On Now, My Juraku
